# Run the app with: uv run uvicorn main:app --reload

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/
Accept: application/json

###

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/spots
Accept: application/json

### Simulate one result from the OpenCV process

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/cameras/demo-camera/detections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "detections": [
    {"spot_id": "A-1", "available": true, "confidence": 0.96},
    {"spot_id": "A-2", "available": false, "confidence": 0.91}
  ]
}

### Watch live events (keep this request open, then run the POST above)

WEBSOCKET ws://127.0.0.1:8000/ws/parking
